Creator: Minh
1. What this website is: A banking website is a secure, digital portal that allows customers to access financial services, check account balances, transfer funds, pay bills, and manage loans or investments from an internet-connected device, all without visiting a physical branch.
2. How it uses the data files in data: We will synthetically generate data for this website. This data should have at least multiple users with different types of account. 
3. What real world websites it should be modeled after: Amex, Chase, TD, ...
4. Whether the domain has temporal/dynamic data (and how it should simulate): this domain is relatively dynamic
5. Any domain-specific behavior or constraints: emphasis on authentication nature of the site